    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing his night shift, construction worker Chen Lin is suddenly confronted with a series of bizarre events: his girlfriend Jiayi goes missing, strange dolls appear, and he finds himself inexplicably chased by Jiayi herself. What lies behind these eerie occurrences?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When faced with threats, fear arises from a lack of power\u2014unfortunately, this game doesn\u2019t provide weapons. The psychological terror heightens your adrenaline. Unarmed and vulnerable, listen carefully\u2014footsteps are approaching! Rely on your sharp observation skills to evade the unknown pursuer. When cornered, conserve your energy and find a way to escape. During the relentless cycle of fleeing, don\u2019t forget to thoroughly examine items, explore your surroundings for clues, and gather essential tools. Piece together the puzzles and uncover the full story behind the mystery!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing his night shift, construction worker Chen Lin is suddenly confronted with a series of bizarre events: his girlfriend Jiayi goes missing, strange dolls appear, and he finds himself inexplicably chased by Jiayi herself. What lies behind these eerie occurrences?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When faced with threats, fear arises from a lack of power\u2014unfortunately, this game doesn\u2019t provide weapons. The psychological terror heightens your adrenaline. Unarmed and vulnerable, listen carefully\u2014footsteps are approaching! Rely on your sharp observation skills to evade the unknown pursuer. When cornered, conserve your energy and find a way to escape. During the relentless cycle of fleeing, don\u2019t forget to thoroughly examine items, explore your surroundings for clues, and gather essential tools. Piece together the puzzles and uncover the full story behind the mystery!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Chase &amp; Escape&quot; is a single-player horror game about Chen Lin, a construction worker. After his night shift, his girlfriend Jiayi vanishes, strange dolls appear, and he\u2019s chased by her. What\u2019s behind these eerie events? Discover the truth!",
